<section class="bhd-page__prose-grid">
  <article class="bhd-page__prose">
    <p class="bhd-page__kicker">Why Best Hydrate</p>
    <h2>Built from a real need</h2>
    <p>After a serious health experience, founder Austin started looking more closely at hydration: what products contained, how fluid absorption works and why the category could be hard to make sense of.</p>
    <p>That search became Best Hydrate. The goal is simple: make a practical hydration product, explain why each ingredient is there and keep improving as the evidence grows.</p>
  </article>
  <aside class="bhd-page__callout">
    <span class="bhd-page__callout-label">Core idea</span>
    <h3>Hydration is not one-size-fits-all.</h3>
    <p>Needs change with activity, environment, diet and health. Sometimes water is enough. Sometimes electrolytes and carbohydrate can help.</p>
  </aside>
</section>

<section class="bhd-page__feature">
  <div>
    <p class="bhd-page__kicker">Mission</p>
    <h2>Make better hydration easier to understand and use</h2>
    <p>We explain what is in our formula and why, when electrolyte drinks may be useful and where ordinary water still makes sense. We aim to be useful without overstating what a hydration product can do.</p>
  </div>
</section>

