    <h2>Every ingredient should have a reason to be there</h2>
    <p>Best Hydrate combines glucose, sodium chloride, potassium chloride, sodium bicarbonate, citric acid and lemon powder. Our formula pages explain what each ingredient does and where the evidence is established physiology rather than a product-specific outcome.</p>
